OL,3,AMillions vote early in US midterms as
OL,4,ADemocrat's shock Republican endorsement
OL,5,Arocks Michigan race
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, a row has erupted in the
OL,8,FDemocratic Party after Michigan
OL,9,Fcongresswoman Haley Stevens, who missed
OL,10,Fout on the party's Senate nomination in
OL,11,Fthe state to Abdul El-Sayed, endorsed
OL,12,FRepublican rival Mike Rogers
OL,14,FMillions of Americans have already
OL,15,Fvoted, with a new midterm record set in
OL,16,FGeorgia, where a third of all
OL,17,Fregistered voters state-wide have cast
OL,18,Ftheir ballots already
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
