OL,3,AMillions vote early in US midterms as
OL,4,ADemocrat's shock Republican endorsement
OL,5,Arocks Michigan race
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump's Republican party currently
OL,8,Fcontrols both chambers of Congress -
OL,9,Fthe Senate and the House of
OL,10,FRepresentatives. Democrats are hoping
OL,11,Fto flip enough seats to win a majority
OL,13,FWhat's up for grabs? All 435 seats in
OL,14,Fthe House; 35 of the 100 seats in the
OL,15,FSenate; and some state-level
OL,16,Fpoliticians, including governors - read
OL,17,Four basic guide
